        646.9136352539062
      ],
      "text": "Some of the most important decisions of our lives occur while we're feeling\nstressed and anxious. From medical decisions to financial and professional\nones, we are all sometimes required to weigh up information under stressful\nconditions. But do we become better or worse at processing and using\ninformation under such circumstances?\n"
    },
