        691.834716796875,
        520.051025390625,
        770.152587890625
      ],
      "text": "My colleague and I, both neuroscientists, wanted to investigate how the mind\noperates under stress, so we visited some local fire stations. Firefighters'\nworkdays vary quite a bit. Some are pretty relaxed; they'll spend their time\nwashing the truck, cleaning equipment, cooking meals and reading. Other days\n"
